{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something dark and unsettling lurks beneath the surface of a seemingly quiet town. As people are vanishing without a trace, dive deeper into a grotesque and bizarre mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover horrific and unnatural things lurking inside people's ears. Creeping insects, strange objects, and other unspeakable anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878740/extras/99909d1981f1706bb84cb6ac9f3b9dde.poster.avif?t=1753378753\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878740/extras/99909d1981f1706bb84cb6ac9f3b9dde.webp?t=1753378753\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric Retro Horror: Immerse yourself in a haunting retro-inspired world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unnatural Body Horror: Encounter disturbing, grotesque and invasive horrors hidden within the bodies of those around you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious Storyline: Unravel the chilling mystery behind the missing townsfolk</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3878740?t=1753378753","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878740/298fb2b31535c724e654471197d29807ec636e32/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753378753","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878740/6ba58cbd2565b267ade5e1af4111487ea5b1340d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753378753","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878740/6ba58cbd2565b267ade5e1af4111487ea5b1340d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753378753","categories"